lass="r-91rqw3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>While you can certainly take monthlies powder for its potential benefits, it's important to note that hormonal contraceptives, such as implants and pills, can affect hormone levels.  </p><br><p>Since hormonal contraceptives regulate your hormone balance, the efficacy of the powder might be compromised by the contraceptive method you are using.</p></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3072571d-f9cc-4dcb-b747-efe2b3e028ae" class="r-1pvignc"><div data-rid="99d5ca50-b7ce-49d5-b6b4-a9c8a68dad08" data-alchemy-url-hashmark="studies" tabindex="-1" id="studies" data-alchemy-url-hashmark-ignore="true" class="r-1xb5rno"><div data-rid="25d7aba9-3570-44d7-9f93-d0086e471110" class="r-oexe9 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-color:#2A2A2A;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-fontsize:12px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-textalign:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-fontfamily:Quicksand;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-fontweight:700;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-lineheight:16px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-textshadow:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b73f-26639a2f7dc0-attributes-textstroke:undefined;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-9f775258-2b0d-43d7-b